0..80 Comment "//! A judgement blocked on an owed hole waits; it is not refused. A value at the"
81..160 Comment "//! decode of a code the module owes cannot be checked until the code is filled"
161..243 Comment "//! — filling it with `Integer` settles the comparison, filling it with `String`"
244..323 Comment "//! refutes it — so the checker suspends the declaration, records the hole it"
324..380 Comment "//! waits on, and owes that hole until a fill resumes it"
381..459 Comment "//! [Slattery-2026-bidirectional_elaborators_carte], Exegesis 6.6: suspension,"
460..524 Comment "//! not failure. The same declarations over a filled code check."
525..528 Comment "//!"
529..589 Comment "//! - cites: [Slattery-2026-bidirectional_elaborators_carte]"
590..593 Comment "//!"
594..742 Comment "//! [Slattery-2026-bidirectional_elaborators_carte]: https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.09564 \"Slattery and Sterling, Bidirectional Elaborators à la Carte\""
